  "ruleText": "Cor 701.01 Purpose. The purpose of this rule shall be to establish procedures governing physical plant management for New Hampshire department of corrections (NHDOC) facilities.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Cor 700) #12892, eff 9-28-19",
